      "lat": 52.3676008,
      "lng": 4.888477,
      "description": "One of the oldest, still in use Mennonite church in Amsterdam. This was one of many of the \"hidden churches\" throughout the city. Website: http://www.doopsgezindamsterdam.nl/",
